OL,3,GNEWSAYour photos: Cold spells bring    
OL,4,Afrosted landscapes                     
OL,6,FIf you found yourself wearing three    
OL,7,Flayers of knitwear, running late for   
OL,8,Fwork because you had to de-ice the car,
OL,9,For your hand darting for that          
OL,10,Fthermostat this week, you will know    
OL,11,Fwinter is creeping in.                 
OL,13,FBut our BBC Weather Watchers are made  
OL,14,Fof strong stuff, and as always, they   
OL,15,Fstill braved the cold to send us some  
OL,16,Fsnaps.                                 
OL,18,FHere are some of the coolest...        
OL,20,FFind out how to join in with Weather   
OL,21,FWatchers here. Or send your photos to  
OL,22,FLook North.                            
